# ── Frontend configuration ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# API base URL for frontend network calls (fetch + SSE).
# Leave empty to use the same origin as the frontend:
#   - dev:  Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts)
#   - prod: served behind a reverse proxy next to the backend (docker-compose)
#
# Set it only when the frontend and backend live on different origins:

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=